		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><br /><p>J&#039;ai modifié ma requête comme ci-dessous mais j&#039;ai toujours des mois manquants...</p><br /><div class="codebox"><pre><code>WITH mois AS (SELECT num, to_char(to_timestamp(num::TEXT,&#039;MM&#039;), &#039;TMMonth&#039;) AS mois FROM generate_series(1,12) num)

SELECT 
 EXTRACT(MONTH FROM b.date)::SMALLINT AS num,
 a.mois AS mois,
 sum(b.temps::TIME) AS nb_heure 

FROM mois a
  LEFT JOIN schema.operation b ON EXTRACT(MONTH FROM b.date) = a.num

GROUP BY EXTRACT(MONTH FROM b.date), a.mois 

ORDER BY num ;</code></pre></div>]]></content>
